  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Frantic battlefields necessitate the ability to cast on your feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Athletics sphere (Mobile Striker), caster level 1st.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a full-round action, you can move up to your speed and use a magic sphere effect which would normally be usable as a standard action. You can move both before and after the effect, but you must move at least 10 feet using a movement mode associated with a package you possess before the attack and the total distance that you move cannot be greater than your speed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc66\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
